WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.100
JOHNNY: They ought to make the day the time changes the first day of summer.

2
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
BARBRA: A lot of good the extra daylight does us. We've still got a long drive back.

3
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
JOHNNY: I think you complain just to hear yourself talk. There it is.

4
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:07.000
BARBRA: I wonder what happened to the one from last year. Each year we spend good money on these things. We come out here and the one from last year is gone.

5
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.100
JOHNNY: The flowers die, and the caretaker or somebody takes them away.

6
00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:17.100
BARBRA: A little spit and polish and they could clean this up and sell it next year. Wonder how many times we bought the same one.

7
00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:37.100
JOHNNY: Ready? Come on, Barb. Church was this morning.

8
00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:04.000
JOHNNY: Hey, I mean praying's for church. Come on.

9
00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:11.000
BARBRA: I haven't seen you in church lately. JOHNNY: Not much sense in my going to church.

10
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:21.000
BARBRA: Do you remember one time when we were small, we were out here? It was from right over there, I jumped out at you from behind the tree, and grandpa got all excited and shook his fist at me and said, "Boy, you'll be damned to hell."

11
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:27.100
BARBRA: Remember that? Right over there. You used to really be scared here.

12
00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:33.100
JOHNNY: You're still afraid! BARBRA: Stop it now, I mean it.

13
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:44.100
JOHNNY: They're coming to get you, Barbra. BARBRA: Stop it. You're ignorant.

14
00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:48.000
JOHNNY: They're coming for you, Barbra. BARBRA: Stop it, you're acting like a child.

15
00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:55.000
JOHNNY: They're coming for you! Look, there comes one of them now!

16
00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:59.000
BARBRA: He'll hear you! JOHNNY: Here he comes now! I'm getting out of here!
